eath rules and leaves surviving objects at their actual positions; no remote return, material duplication or refund of spent time/energy. No autonomous labor or unattended force application. No ongoing upkeep is charged merely for an annotation; placed material persists subject to existing physical processes, with no promised durability. Any maintenance is separately selected real inspection, adjustment or recovery at the disclosed operation cost. Compile these checks and state transitions into code, not repeated model adjudication.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Study, registration, requests, queries, naming and mastery produce no experience benefit. This development adds no direct reward grant or protected-account write. A paid observation, informative failure or real familiar practice may be eligible only through an existing applicable experience handler, with source/revision/event deduplication and personal relevance. Re-inspecting an unchanged record is not new information. Any enabled benefit must have that handler's explicit bounded amount, cap, decay and cooldown; if no such bounded handler exists, award zero rather than inventing one. No pleasure or satisfaction is inferred from intended success, and no ongoing benefit arises from a dormant arrangement. Physical comfort is not established by this trial and cannot exceed the global cap of 10; nutrition is unchanged by mood. Do not alter reward accounts, budgets, goals or permissions.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit observable events only for actual paid examinations, manipulations, measured tests and recovery. Retain dated private evidence linked to actor, exact sources, revisions, method, units, uncertainty and process/arrangement IDs; do not disclose hidden source properties. Use reusable metadata with component, source references, actual geometry when known, state, progress, timestamp and evidence-event IDs. Assessment overlays are dashed non-solid annotations, clearly marked measured, estimated or unresolved; they are not material objects. Render a real placed vine or branch only after physical placement, with allocated material removed from the corresponding available source representation. Distinguish assessed, positioned, partially wrapped, wrapped-unverified, testing, slipped, damaged, paused, cancelled and recovered states. Never display a joined/success badge for registration, an incomplete wrap, unsupported force mechanics or an inconclusive test. Motion and force indicators must follow actual events, not merely the submitted target. Do not infer satisfaction from the visual result or make private findings public automatically.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

